22 Type of treatment used in the past (response and side effects) and currently being used. \n\u2022 If the patient has failed to respond to optimal first-line treatment. \nReferences \n1. Australian Medicines Handbook Children\u2019s Dosing Companion Online [internet] Australia: \nAustralian Medicines Handbook Pty. Ltd.; 2022.", "type": "Document"}}